/* HID: a human interface device, apart from the bus that carries it.
 *
 * `import Library.HID;` brings the device contract. A bus presents a device
 * that implements it: `Library.USB.USBHID` as a USB interface,
 * `Library.Bluetooth.BluetoothHID` as a Bluetooth HID device. */

import Library.HID.HIDDevice;
